      "alt": "TQMa6ULx Energy-efficient and future-oriented Cortex®-A7 module",
      "text": "<h1>Based on i.MX6UL and i.MX6ULL.</h1>\n<p>The TQMa6ULx is an energy-efficient Cortex®-A7 module based on i.MX6UL and i.MX6ULL, designed for long-term availability and featuring security functions. It offers a camera sensor interface and boasts low power consumption (typ. 1 W). Additionally, it includes 2x Ethernet with IEE1588 support and an extended temperature range, making it suitable for various applications, such as industrial automation and controls.</p>",
      "displayPopupTitle": "true",
      "linkTarget": "_self",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Sep 01 2026 01:43:14 GMT+0000",
      "titleValueFromDAM": "true",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/textwithimage",
